{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55726","headline":"偶覩春时花蘂繁发忽然发悟喜不自胜乃作一偈 · 志懃","name":"偶覩春时花蘂繁发忽然发悟喜不自胜乃作一偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来寻剑客，几逢花发（《景德传灯录》作「落叶」）几（《五灯会元》作「又」）抽枝。\n（《祖堂集》卷十作「叶落几回再抽枝」。\n）自从一见桃花後，直至如今更不疑。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十九、卷十、《景德传灯录》卷十一、《五灯会元》卷四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"志懃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}